{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Maja is a\u00a0primordial sea monster, and you are trapped on an island with it. The only way to escape is to take it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sail through an open world island in your trusty boat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e596a20eaca9447702a61bac6415364d.poster.avif?t=1761849641\" width=800 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e596a20eaca9447702a61bac6415364d.webm?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e596a20eaca9447702a61bac6415364d.mp4?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> <br>Plan your route carefully. Maja stalks the waters, but the island holds its own dangers the results of failed attempts to take down the creature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your boat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/c11f8d8c28885dda8997bd64f0259287.poster.avif?t=1761849641\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/c11f8d8c28885dda8997bd64f0259287.webm?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/c11f8d8c28885dda8997bd64f0259287.mp4?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find &quot;scraps&quot; by exploring\u00a0 and or completing missions, and use them to upgrade your boat. Your boat is your lifeline keep it strong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work with what\u2019s left of the science team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/b4d0a49550a0f284b434736824b61486.poster.avif?t=1761849641\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/b4d0a49550a0f284b434736824b61486.webm?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/b4d0a49550a0f284b434736824b61486.mp4?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Collaborate with the remnants of the science team to acquire new weapons and essential tools for destroying Maja.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Maja to Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e48209560891ce5e581b1b2562317bbd.poster.avif?t=1761849641\" width=799 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/extras/e48209560891ce5e581b1b2562317bbd.webm?t=1761849641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Maja in the ultimate showdown and escape the island after completing the main questline. Victory depends on whether you\u2019ve gained enough skill, strength, and firepower to take it down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758440?t=1761849641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758440?t=1761849641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758440/d05a498b9b21b4471a9455b680813f7321